    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>(Problem solved by at least one) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi></math>(Problem is not solved by all)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>D</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
